 Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 26.4px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 26.4px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">RISE사업단에서는 반도체 이론 중심 교육의 한계를 보완하고 반도체 핵심 직무에 실무형 인재 양성을 위해 반도체 공정기술 직무부트캠프를 진행하고자 하오니 많은 신청 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 26.4px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">[모집</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">안내</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">]</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">1.</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">교 육 명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">:</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">「</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">2025</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">년 반도체 공정기술 직무부트캠프</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">」 3차</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">2.</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">교육장소</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">포항공과대학교 나노융합기술원(경상북도 포항시 지곡로 127번길 31, 포항공과대학 內)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">교육일시:&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">2025</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">년</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;11</span></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">월</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;17</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">) ~ 2025</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">년</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;11</span></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">월</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;21</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">) (4</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">박</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">5</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">집체교육</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">4.</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">모집인원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: 16</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(선착순 모집, 성비를 고려하여 인원이 조정될 수 있음)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">5.</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">모집기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: ~ 2025</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">년</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;9</span></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">월</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;26</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">) 15</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">시까지&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">6.</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">신청자격</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">:</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">본교 재학생</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">학년 이상(모집 미달시, 3학년도 참여 가능)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 51.8pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -51.8pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">7.</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">신청방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">:</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">국립금오공과대학교 학생역량관리시스템</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(BISKIT / https://biskit.kumoh.ac.kr)</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">비교과프로그램을 통해 신청</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 51.8pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -51.8pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">8.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -67.4pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">교육내용</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -67.4pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"text-indent: -67.4pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">안</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -67.4pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 67.4pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -67.4pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12pt;\">클린룸(청정실) 청정도 등급 이해, 출입시 준수사항 및 안전관리 숙지</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 67.4pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -67.4pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -89.8667px;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12pt;\">Photo(Lithography)/Etching Process : 포토(노광)/식각(Dry-습식) 과정 기술 습득</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 67.4pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -67.4pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -89.8667px;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12pt;\">Diffusion/Thinfilm Process : 확산(급속열산화막)/박막(물리, 화학증착) 기술 습득</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 67.4pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -67.4pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -89.8667px;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12pt;\">Cleaning/Measurement Process : 세정/두께 측정·현상 확인 과정 기술 습득</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 67.4pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -67.4pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -89.8667px;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12pt;\">실습교육을 통한 실제 장비운용 원리·방법 이해</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 68.7pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -68.7pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">※</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">교육내용은 변경될 수 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">[</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">유의사항</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">]</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">-</span><strong style=\"line-height: 1; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><b>1, 2차(7~8월) 부트캠프 기참여자 참여 제한 (</b></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><b>모집 미달시 개별 연락 예정)</b></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: bold; line-height: 1; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">-프로그램 취소시기 이후&nbsp;개인사정 등으로 불참시, 추후 RISE사업단 반도체 부트캠프 참여 제한</span></strong></strong></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">-집결 및 집합 시간 준수</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">-캠프&nbsp;중 개인 이동 및 개인 숙박 불가(안내자의 안내에 따를 것)</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">-안전을 위해 편안한 복장(바지) 및 운동화 착용 권장, FAB 공정 실습 교육시 화장 불가(캡모자 등 모자 지참 선택)</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">-포항에서 5일간 진행되는 교육으로 5일간 숙박과 교육 모두 참석가능한 학생</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">-식사 및 숙박 제공(참여비용 없음), <b>Biskit 마일리지 제공</b> 및 수료증 발</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">급</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">-학기 중 캠프로 <b>해당 캠프일자 공결처리</b> 예정</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 14pt;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">[문의처]</span></b></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">RISE</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">사업단</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">054-478-6730</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">※선발학생에 한해 금오톡톡 PUSH로 발송됩니다. 금오톡톡 확인을 부탁드립니다.</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
